{"id": "t022-003", "text": "Ahmed doesn't drink at all, so get alcohol-free stuff in for the barbecue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get alcohol-free stuff in for the barbecue", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t022-006", "text": "Lunch with Anders and his wife Ines. They're moving to Gothenburg sometime in the spring, probably April. Ines is a bit anxious about finding work there, she's a midwife and her Swedish is still basic. Anders has already lined up a job with an engineering firm and starts on 1 May 2027. They're having a leaving do sometime in March. Anders asked for recommendations for Swedish crime novels, he's working his way through all of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Gothenburg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "midwife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Swedish is still basic", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job with an engineering firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 May 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in March", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Swedish crime novels", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t022-008", "text": "Dalia cancelled her trip to Lisbon after all, the flights got too expensive. She's doing a pottery course on Tuesday nights instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery course", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday nights"}]}
{"id": "t022-011", "text": "Ifeoma's mum is having a hip replacement next Tuesday. Ifeoma is going to stay with her for a week afterwards. Must call her the weekend after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-017", "text": "Arturo said his band has a gig at the Fleece next Thursday. He plays bass. They're called Lowland Static. I'm going with Jen.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Fleece", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Lowland Static", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t022-019", "text": "Haruto has started making his own ramen from scratch, takes him two days. He's after a proper stockpot, hint hint.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "making his own ramen from scratch", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "after a proper stockpot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t022-022", "text": "Tendai is training for the Cardiff half marathon in March 2027. He's doing long runs every Sunday and has cut out beer completely until then. He's raising money for a mental health charity because of what happened with his cousin. He said the knee is holding up but his calves are wrecked. Remind me to sponsor him this weekend, and I should ask how the twenty mile run goes next Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Cardiff half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut out beer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until then", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "raising money for a mental health charity", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee is holding up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the twenty mile run goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twenty mile run", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t022-024", "text": "Francesca's daughter starts nursery after half term. Fran is dreading the drop-offs, says her little one cries whenever she leaves the room. I should text her that first morning to see how it went, and maybe take her for a coffee afterwards. She also mentioned she's given up on her running club for now, which is a shame because she loved it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fran", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the drop-offs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that first morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running club", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t022-026", "text": "Ayo's sister Chioma is graduating in the summer, medicine at Edinburgh. He's so proud of her. I'd like to get her something for it, maybe a nice stethoscope.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "medicine at Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her something for it", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t022-032", "text": "Long catch-up with Nora over dinner. She's had a rough few months. Her dad was diagnosed with Parkinson's in the summer and she's been going up to Durham most weekends to help her mum. She's thinking about going part time at work after Christmas so she can be there more. She also mentioned she's taken up crochet to stay sane, which I love. I should call her sometime next week and maybe send her a nice crochet pattern book.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough few months", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Parkinson's", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crochet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a nice crochet pattern book", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t022-033", "text": "Anders is a massive Liverpool fan, watches every match even at 5am when he's travelling.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Liverpool", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5am"}]}
{"id": "t022-035", "text": "Ifeoma's not drinking caffeine anymore, migraines. Get decaf in before she visits on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not drinking caffeine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "migraines", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get decaf in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visits", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-036", "text": "Uma's band is playing a battle of the bands on 14 November 2026. She's the drummer and she's been practising every night. She's really nervous. Don't forget to message her good luck on the day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "battle of the bands", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-039", "text": "Remind me to book a table somewhere vegetarian for Aneesh's leaving drinks. It's sometime in early December, date TBC.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book a table somewhere vegetarian for Aneesh's leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-040", "text": "Sadia is learning Japanese for a trip to Tokyo next autumn. She practises on Duolingo every day and is up to a 200 day streak. Her husband Tunde is less keen, he's mostly excited about the food and has a list of ramen shops already. They're going for three weeks, possibly in October 2027 if work allows. Sadia's also really into Studio Ghibli and wants to visit the museum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Japanese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Tokyo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next autumn", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "less keen", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly excited about the food", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ramen shops", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "possibly in October 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to visit the museum", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t022-043", "text": "Jen says the work Christmas party has been called off this year. Budget cuts. Instead a few of us are doing drinks at hers on Friday 18 December. Jen only drinks gin and has strong opinions about tonic, so I'll bring a nice bottle. Her partner Arturo is cooking, he's doing a Mexican spread because Jen can't stand anything too creamy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drinks at hers", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday 18 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks gin", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "strong opinions about tonic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand anything too creamy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t022-044", "text": "Haruto Sato supports the Yokohama Marinos and gets up at stupid o'clock to stream their games. Also loves anything with yuzu.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto Sato", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Yokohama Marinos", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "stupid o'clock"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "yuzu", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t022-048", "text": "Tendai's partner Esther is a pastry chef at a hotel in town. She makes the best canelés. Tendai says she wants a proper stand mixer, they still use a hand whisk.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pastry chef at a hotel", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "canelés", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper stand mixer", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t022-049", "text": "Valentina has a hospital appointment on the 27th about her knee. She's had the injury since playing netball last year. I should ask how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hospital appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "injury", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t022-055", "text": "Esther and Tendai are buying their first house! Completion is sometime in January. Remind me to get them a housewarming plant when they're in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "buying their first house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them a housewarming plant", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're in", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-057", "text": "Hemi follows the All Blacks religiously and will be at the Twickenham match on 7 November 2026 with her brother Pieter. They've had the tickets for months. She's making a day of it, brunch beforehand at the place by the station, then the match, then dinner. Pieter is gluten free so she's been ringing around restaurants. She also plays touch rugby on Wednesday evenings, which I didn't know.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "All Blacks", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Twickenham match", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "touch rugby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evenings"}]}
